  <data name="About.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>About Nemeris</value></data>
  <data name="About.Lead" xml:space="preserve"><value>We believe great products should be easy to find. Nemeris brings a curated selection of quality items to your door — simply, quickly and fairly.</value></data>
  <data name="About.Body1" xml:space="preserve"><value>Nemeris started with a simple idea: online shopping should feel effortless. No cluttered catalogues, no hidden costs — just a carefully chosen range, honest prices and fast delivery.</value></data>
  <data name="About.Body2" xml:space="preserve"><value>Today we serve customers across the Benelux and beyond. We work directly with trusted suppliers, check every product that enters our warehouse and keep improving the experience with every order.</value></data>
  <data name="About.Stat1Value" xml:space="preserve"><value>10 000+</value></data>
  <data name="About.Stat1Label" xml:space="preserve"><value>Happy customers</value></data>
  <data name="About.Stat2Value" xml:space="preserve"><value>2 500+</value></data>
  <data name="About.Stat2Label" xml:space="preserve"><value>Products in store</value></data>
  <data name="About.Stat3Value" xml:space="preserve"><value>24 h</value></data>
  <data name="About.Stat3Label" xml:space="preserve"><value>Average dispatch time</value></data>
  <data name="About.ValuesTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>What we stand for</value></data>
  <data name="About.Value1Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Quality first</value></data>
  <data name="About.Value1Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Every product is checked before it ships. Not good enough? It does not go out.</value></data>
  <data name="About.Value2Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Honest prices</value></data>
  <data name="About.Value2Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>No hidden fees or inflated discounts — the price you see is the price you pay.</value></data>
  <data name="About.Value3Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>People over process</value></data>
  <data name="About.Value3Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Questions are answered by real people who can actually help, within one business day.</value></data>
  <data name="Contact.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Contact us</value></data>
  <data name="Contact.Lead" xml:space="preserve"><value>Questions about an order, a product or anything else? Send us a message — we usually reply within one business day.</value></data>
