  <data name="Service.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>FAQ</value></data>
  <data name="Service.Lead" xml:space="preserve"><value>Answers to the most common questions about ordering, shipping and returns.</value></data>
  <data name="Service.ShippingTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Shipping</value></data>
  <data name="Service.ShippingText" xml:space="preserve"><value>Orders placed before 22:00 ship the same day. Delivery takes 1–3 business days and is free over €50.</value></data>
  <data name="Service.ReturnsTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Returns</value></data>
  <data name="Service.ReturnsText" xml:space="preserve"><value>Changed your mind? Return any item within 30 days for a full refund — no questions asked.</value></data>
  <data name="Service.PaymentTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Payment</value></data>
  <data name="Service.PaymentText" xml:space="preserve"><value>Pay safely with Bancontact, credit card or PayPal. All payments are encrypted.</value></data>
  <data name="Service.FaqTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Frequently asked questions</value></data>
  <data name="Service.Faq1Q" xml:space="preserve"><value>Where is my order?</value></data>
  <data name="Service.Faq1A" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sign in and open “My orders” to see the current status of every order. You will also receive an email as soon as your package ships.</value></data>
  <data name="Service.Faq2Q" xml:space="preserve"><value>Can I change or cancel my order?</value></data>
  <data name="Service.Faq2A" xml:space="preserve"><value>As long as the order has not shipped, contact us and we will adjust or cancel it for you.</value></data>
  <data name="Service.Faq3Q" xml:space="preserve"><value>How do I return an item?</value></data>
  <data name="Service.Faq3A" xml:space="preserve"><value>Contact us within 30 days of delivery and we will email you a prepaid return label. Refunds are processed within 5 business days after we receive the item.</value></data>
  <data name="Service.Faq4Q" xml:space="preserve"><value>Do products come with a warranty?</value></data>
  <data name="Service.Faq4A" xml:space="preserve"><value>Yes — all products carry the legal two-year warranty. Something broken? We will repair, replace or refund it.</value></data>
  <data name="Service.Faq5Q" xml:space="preserve"><value>Which countries do you deliver to?</value></data>
  <data name="Service.Faq5A" xml:space="preserve"><value>We currently deliver to Belgium, the Netherlands, Luxembourg and France. More countries are on the way.</value></data>
  <data name="Service.MoreHelp" xml:space="preserve"><value>Still need help?</value></data>
  <data name="Service.MoreHelpText" xml:space="preserve"><value>Our team is happy to help you personally.</value></data>
  <data name="Service.ContactCta" xml:space="preserve"><value>Contact us</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Privacy policy</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.Updated" xml:space="preserve"><value>Last updated: July 2026</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.Intro" xml:space="preserve"><value>Nemeris respects your privacy. This policy explains which personal data we collect, why we collect it and what your rights are.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.S1Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>What we collect</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.S1Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>We store the details you give us when creating an account or placing an order: your name, email address, delivery addresses, order history and phone number if provided.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.S2Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>How we use your data</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.S2Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Your data is used to process orders, arrange delivery, provide customer support and — only with your consent — send you updates about products and offers.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.S3Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Cookies</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.S3Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>We use functional cookies to keep you signed in, remember your cart and store your language preference. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.S4Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Sharing with third parties</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.S4Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>We only share data with partners who are needed to fulfil your order, such as delivery services and payment providers. We never sell your data.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.S5Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Retention and security</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.S5Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Data is stored on secured servers within the EU and kept no longer than legally required. Payments are always encrypted.</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.S6Title" xml:space="preserve"><value>Your rights</value></data>
  <data name="Privacy.S6Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>You may request access to, correction of or deletion of your personal data at any time. Contact us and we will respond within 30 days.</value></data>
